{number: 52}
{title: Wonderful Words Of Life}
{key: G}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[G] Sing them over again to me, wonderful words of [D7] life;
Let me more of their beauty see, wonderful words of [G] life;
Words of [C] life and [G] beauty, teach me [C] faith and [G] duty.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D7] Beautiful words, [G] wonderful words,
[D7] Wonderful words of [G] life;
[D7] Beautiful words, [G] wonderful words,
[D7] Wonderful words of [G] life.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[G] Christ, the blessed One, gives to all, wonderful words of [D7] life;
Sinner, list to the loving call, wonderful words of [G] life.
All so [C] freely [G] given, wooing [C] us to [G] heaven.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[G] Sweetly echo the gospel call, wonderful words of [D7] life,
Offer pardon and peace to all, wonderful words of [G] life.
Jesus, [C] only [G] Saviour, sancti-[C] fy for [G] ever.
{end_of_verse}
